    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d739">

                <pb facs="0578" n="496" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg496"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Provisional President de la
                        Barra</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-05-27"><hi rendition="#italic">May 27,
                        1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Having the most agreeable recollections of our intercourse at Washington, I beg
                    your excellency to accept my personal felicitations on the confidence imposed in
                    you by the Mexican Congress and my best wishes for the success of your
                    administration.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Knox.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
